    {
      "sentences": [
        {
          "en": "A moody game This game helps the child to match words to feelings.",
          "zh": "一个喜怒无常的游戏这个游戏帮助这孩子到比赛单词到触觉。",
          "startMs": 38770,
          "endMs": 47793
        },
        {
          "en": "• Choose one of the moods from the story: 'noisy\", 'silly, 'cross\", 'grumpy\", 'unhappy'.",
          "zh": "• 选择一的这心情从这故事： '喧闹的， '傻的， '叉形， '脾气坏的， '痛苦的'。",
          "startMs": 47793,
          "endMs": 59825
        },
        {
          "en": "Choose one of them to act out, for the child to guess.",
          "zh": "选择一的他们到行为出， 为了这孩子到猜测。",
          "startMs": 59825,
          "endMs": 67208
        },
        {
          "en": "If it is too hard, give a choice.",
          "zh": "如果它是也困难的， 给一个选择。",
          "startMs": 67208,
          "endMs": 71719
        },
        {
          "en": "Was I being silly or unhappy?\"",
          "zh": "是我正在傻的或者痛苦的？",
          "startMs": 71719,
          "endMs": 75821
        },
        {
          "en": "Ask the child to choose a word to act out, for you to guess.",
          "zh": "问这孩子到选择一个单词到行为出， 为了你到猜测。",
          "startMs": 75821,
          "endMs": 84024
        },
        {
          "en": "Have three turns each.",
          "zh": "有三转动每个。",
          "startMs": 84024,
          "endMs": 87032
        },
        {
          "en": "You can use these ideas straight away, or on another day.",
          "zh": "你能使用这些主意直的离开， 或者在……上另一个一天。",
          "startMs": 87032,
          "endMs": 94825
        },
        {
          "en": "Practise reading the words ending with y'.",
          "zh": "练习读这单词结尾和……一起第二未知量'。",
          "startMs": 94825,
          "endMs": 100567
        },
        {
          "en": "Draw pictures of the sun, rain clouds, and a snowflake.",
          "zh": "画图画的这太阳， 雨云， 和一个雪花。",
          "startMs": 100567,
          "endMs": 108087
        },
        {
          "en": "Ask the child to say what kind of weather each picture depicts.",
          "zh": "问这孩子到说什么友善的的天气每个图画描画。",
          "startMs": 108087,
          "endMs": 116700
        }
